KrishiSetu AI — Third-Party Data & Service Attributions
=========================================================

This project incorporates and attributes the following third-party data
sources and APIs, matching the attributions displayed in the application UI:

1. Weather Forecasts — Open-Meteo
   Source: https://open-meteo.com/
   License: CC BY 4.0 (Non-commercial free tier)
   Attribution: "Weather data by Open-Meteo.com"

2. Crop Nutrition Data — USDA FoodData Central (SR Legacy)
   Source: https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/
   License: Public Domain (CC0 1.0)
   Attribution: "U.S. Department of Agriculture, Agricultural Research Service.
   FoodData Central, SR Legacy."

3. Crop Recommendation Dataset — Atharva Ingle
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Dataset: 2,200 soil & climate samples across 22 crops.

4. Indian Administrative Locations — Local Government Directory (LGD)
   31 States/UTs and 61 Districts (coordinates & names).

5. Indian Government Agricultural Schemes
   Curated from official Central & State Ministry portals (including
   pmkisan.gov.in, agriwelfare.gov.in, mnre.gov.in) with direct links to
   official sources.

6. Farmer Advisory Safety Referral
   Kisan Call Centre (Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare, Govt. of India)
   Toll-Free: 1800-180-1551
